WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.535
-Let's talk about "The Voice,"
my friend.

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:05.071
Season 20 premiered earlier
tonight.

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:08.374
It's also the 10th anniversary
of the show.

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:09.842
What can we expect this season?

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:13.812
-It's my 5th season,
and I'm having a blast.

00:00:13.812 --> 00:00:15.648
I love it.
Nick Jonas is back.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:16.449
Our, uh...

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:17.617
-Yeah, we love him.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:19.919
-Our youngest coach.
He just hosted SNL

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.721
and performed so beautifully.

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.456
And he's back as a coach

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.925
and we're having a lot of fun
this season.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:31.464
-And I know Brandy is the mentor
this season for Team Legend.

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:32.699
Have you -- I can't remember.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:34.066
Have you worked with Brandy
before?

00:00:34.066 --> 00:00:35.234
-I worked with her once.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:37.370
We had a song together called
"Quickly."

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:41.040
It was on my 3rd album, Evolver,
and it was actually written by

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.610
Frank Ocean, so that's
a pretty cool combination.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:47.380
Me, Brandy singing together,
a song written by Frank Ocean.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.716
But we hadn't worked together
since then,

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:50.749
and I love Brandy.

00:00:50.749 --> 00:00:51.985
I love her as a vocalist.

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:54.187
I've looked up to her for such
a long time.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:59.859
And so many of my singers on my
team just are super Brandy fans,

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:03.796
and I told her that she isn't
just a great singer,

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:05.130
she's a singer's singer.

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:09.001
That so many artists, so many
singers look up to her

00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:11.637
as an example of just a great,
great vocalist.

00:01:11.637 --> 00:01:16.409
And every time my artists walked
in and discovered Brandy was

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:20.847
their mentor, they just all were
in shock and so thrilled.

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:22.715
And we were so lucky to have
Brandy.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:24.117
-Well, you know what it's like

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:26.919
to be on a show like
"The Voice,"

00:01:26.919 --> 00:01:29.922
because as a kid, I heard that
you wanted to be on

00:01:29.922 --> 00:01:31.991
one of the original singing
competition shows,

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.926
"Star Search," which I'm not
sure...

00:01:33.926 --> 00:01:37.063
-I wanted to be on "Star Search"
so badly.

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:39.232
You know, I used to grow up
watching Ed McMahon --

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:40.299
-Ed McMahon!
-And...

00:01:40.299 --> 00:01:42.301
-Three and three quarter stars!

00:01:42.301 --> 00:01:43.836
-Yeah. [ Laughs ]

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:46.539
And so many great artists
actually came through

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:49.542
"Star Search," and I would watch
the show

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.110
and I was like,
"I want to be on there.

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:52.478
I deserve to be on there."

00:01:52.478 --> 00:01:54.714
And then my local mall --

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:57.683
it was called
the Fairfield Commons Mall,

00:01:57.683 --> 00:01:59.719
outside of Dayton, Ohio.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:02.822
They had a local "Star Search"
competition

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:05.691
and if you won the local
competition,

00:02:05.691 --> 00:02:09.862
they would send your tape to
national "Star Search."

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:13.932
So I won the local "Star Search"
competition

00:02:13.932 --> 00:02:16.402
at the mall of Fairfield Commons
outside of Dayton.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:20.340
They sent my videotape to the
national "Star Search,"

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:22.908
and I never got a call back,
so that was that.

00:02:22.908 --> 00:02:25.011
-[ Laughs ]
Oh, my God.

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:28.514
-But I did -- I did get a $500
shopping spree

00:02:28.514 --> 00:02:30.083
at the new mall,
and...

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:32.385
-That's a lot.
-I bought a lot of clothes.

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:33.585
So, I was happy.

00:02:33.585 --> 00:02:34.954
-I want to show a clip --

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.289
here's a look at tomorrow
night's episode of "The Voice."

00:02:37.289 --> 00:02:38.358
Check it out.

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:40.526
-It's an amazing feeling to feel
the joy

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:42.394
that you have when you perform.

00:02:42.394 --> 00:02:43.863
It's very infectious.

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.332
Not only can you sing, but
you're a real musician

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:47.666
and you come with artistry.

00:02:47.666 --> 00:02:49.568
I would love to work with an
artist like you.

00:02:49.568 --> 00:02:51.436
-And he's not a liar.

00:02:51.436 --> 00:02:52.505
-Wait. Wait a minute.

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:53.906
-Blake is going to lie some
more, so.

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:55.140
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:58.811
-I am the only coach who doesn't
live in Hollywood.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:01.914
I don't ever want to lose sight
of my roots.

00:03:01.914 --> 00:03:03.149
-Wait, what?!

00:03:03.149 --> 00:03:04.082
-All three of you have gone
Hollywood.

00:03:04.082 --> 00:03:05.184
-You came to Hollywood

00:03:05.184 --> 00:03:08.121
and started dating Gwen Stefani.

00:03:08.121 --> 00:03:09.822
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:11.924
The ultimate...
-The Queen of Orange County.

00:03:11.924 --> 00:03:14.727
-The manifestation of
California girl.

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:15.928
-You see how ugly it gets here?

00:03:15.928 --> 00:03:17.129
-I see, I see it.

00:03:17.129 --> 00:03:19.666
-John Legend.
Tune in tomorrow night at 9 PM

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:23.236
on NBC for more of "The Voice"
blind auditions.

